          "text": "Description: On August 7, 1993, around 5:00 AM, three witnesses exiting a nightclub observed a very bright point in the sky. According to the witnesses, the shape was indistinct (either round or triangular), but it remained stationary in the sky. The bright point gradually dimmed with the dawn and disappeared. The witnesses likely observed a very bright star.",
